  "visible_text": "Skip to Content\n↵\nENTER\nSkip to Navigation\n↵\nENTER\nOpen Accessibility Toolbar\n↵\nENTER\nSkip to Footer\n↵\nENTER\nSkip to main content\nCustomer Awareness - Things we will not ask you by call, text, or email\nSecondary Nav\nOnline Banking\nLoan Payments\nLocations\nCareers\nContact\n \nSocial Media\nLinkedIn\nFacebook\nX\nInstagram\nMiddletown Valley Bank\nPrimary Nav\nPersonal Banking\nOverview\nChecking\nSavings\nLending\nHELOC\nCredit Cards\nRetirement\nAdditional Services\nBusiness Banking\nOverview\nChecking\nSavings\nLending\nCredit Cards\nCash Management\nMerchant Services\nAdditional Services\nHome Loans\nResources\nOverview\nHistory & Culture\nOur Team\nHours & Locations\nNews\nCommunity\nFraud Awareness\nFinancial Literacy\nFAQs\nInvestor Relations\nPrevious\nMVB Toy Drive\n\nDonate new toys at any MVB Branch in November for a chance to win the Golden Ticket from Warehouse Cinemas*\n\nLEARN MORE\nExpanding Your Possibilities\n\nYour dream upgrade starts with a SmartFlex HELOC*\n\nLEARN MORE\nTake Advantage of 0%\n\nIntro APR for 21 billing cycles with the Visa Zero+ Card\n\nLEARN MORE\nReward Your Daily Grind\n\nEarn 5¢ back per signature-based transaction with your MVB Visa® Debit Card*.\n\nLEARN MORE\nNext\nOnline Banking Login\nSIGN IN\n\nForgot ID or Password?  |  First Time User\nLogin May Not Work in Older Web Browsers\n\nCredit Card Account Login\n\nCLICK HERE to check your balance, pay your bill, or even start a balance transfer.\n\nAbsolutely Exceptional Experiences\n\nSince 1908, Middletown Valley Bank has been the cornerstone for our customers’ financial planning, residents and businesses alike. Though many advances of the 21st century have made the financial world more competitive, Middletown Valley Bank continues to provide the flexibility and responsiveness only a true community bank can offer. Our exceptional customer service combined with state-of-the-art technology, provides our customers with the best banking experience.\n\nABOUT US\n\nPersonal Banking\n\nWe offer personal banking products to meet your individual needs. From a checking account to a personal line of credit, we have a solution for you.\n\nLEARN MORE\nBusiness Banking\n\nWe offer a variety of banking solutions for any sized organization. Whether you are just starting out, growing or already established we can help.\n\nLEARN MORE\nResidential Mortgage\n\nWe offer a variety of mortgage solutions to fit your financial needs. Let our experienced mortgage bankers guide you through available loan options.\n\nLEARN MORE\nWhat's New at MVB\nNOVEMBER 3, 2026\nHome Inspections\nREAD MORE\nNOVEMBER 2, 2026\nFrederick Branch Closing at 3 PM on Tuesday, November 10th\nREAD MORE\nOCTOBER 29, 2026\nBlack Friday Scams\nREAD MORE\nMVB in the Community\n\nAt MVB we believe in giving back!  We make it a priority to support our local non-profit organizations, as well as encourage our employees to donate their time and talents.\n\nLEARN MORE\n\nPersonal Resources\n\nDo you have a question?  Our FAQ may hold the answer!  If not, just contact our Customer Care Team.  They are always happy to help!\n\nLEARN MORE\n\nCustomer Care Team\n\n(844) 533-9211\nMonday – Friday 8:00 am – 5:00 pm\nSaturday 9:00 am – 12:00 pm\n\n24-Hour Telephone Banking\n\n(855) 371-3040\n\nLost or Stolen Visa Debit Card\n\n(888) 297-3416\n\nNeed Help?\nCONTACT OUR CUSTOMER CARE TEAM\n\nFor your safety and security, please do not include sensitive personal information such as account, social security and personal identification numbers. For specific questions regarding your account, please login to Online Banking or call us at (844) 533-9211.\n\nFirst & Last Name\nEmail Address\nPhone Number\nComments\nCAPTCHA\nMiddletown Valley Bank\n\nMailing Address:\nMiddletown Valley Bank\nP.O. Box 75, Middletown, MD 21769\n\nCustomer Care Team: (844) 533-9211\nCollections Department: (888) 363-9991\n\nSite Map\nHome\nPersonal\nBusiness\nAbout\nInvestors\nContact\nSite Map